 the county&rsquo;s 4 grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 47% of normal in July to August and 44% in November to December. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 17% of normal on the middle of the grids. All 4 grids had their driest year in 1963.</p>"}
